  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Framework cancellation sources are now first-class in the shared in-scope token walk. HttpContext.RequestAborted and ServerCallContext.CancellationToken participate in CC002/CC003/CC004 and sibling rules when no CancellationToken parameter is in scope. Convention middleware Invoke/InvokeAsync(HttpContext) is skipped by CC001 because the pipeline does not inject a token parameter. 36 diagnostics.",
